VISUAL: GitHub repository for Fission-AI/OpenSpec, displaying 58.4k stars, 4.1k forks, TypeScript, and MIT license.
AUDIO: 'confidently builds the wrong thing. Openspec adds the one missing layer, a spec you both agree on before a single line of code gets written. Let me show you why that one change has already won over 58,000 developers. OpenSpec comes'

