VISUAL: GitHub repository for Fission-AI/OpenSpec, displaying 58.4k stars, 4.1k forks, TypeScript, and MIT license.
AUDIO: 'history, OpenSpec captures them as living documents right in your repo, a proposal for why you\'re building something, the specs for what it should do, a design doc for how, and a task checklist to track it. Those four'

[00:49] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: GitHub repository for Fission-AI/OpenSpec, displaying 58.4k stars, 4.1k forks, TypeScript, and MIT license.
